# Stockwise

Stockwise is a cloud-deployed inventory management web application for small business inventory workflows.

This repository uses a nested project structure. The main application source code is located in:


Cloud_inventory-main/


## Project Overview

Stockwise provides inventory management features including product catalog management, sales recording, restock tracking, supplier records, and rule-based inventory insights.

The project is built as a full-stack web application with a React frontend, FastAPI backend, and PostgreSQL database.

## Repository Structure

```text
Cldou_inventory_Stockwise/
├── .github/
