│   ├── backend/
│   ├── docs/
│   ├── tests/
│   ├── README.md
│   └── docker-compose.yml
└── .gitattributes
```

## Main Application

The main project files are organized under:
Cloud_inventory-main/

Key folders:

Cloud_inventory-main/frontend/   React frontend
Cloud_inventory-main/backend/    FastAPI backend
Cloud_inventory-main/docs/       Project screenshots and related assets
Cloud_inventory-main/tests/      Test-related files


## Cloud Deployment and CI

This project includes cloud deployment and CI/CD-related configuration:

- React frontend hosted on AWS Amplify
- FastAPI backend hosted on Render
- PostgreSQL database hosted on Neon
- GitHub Actions workflow for CI checks
- Environment-based configuration for frontend/backend connectivity
- Restricted CORS configuration between the deployed frontend and backend

The CI workflow is located at:


.github/workflows/ci.yml

The deployment runbook is located at:


docs/deployment-runbook.md
```

